      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Neil and Robert will discuss their own experience of writing a Wayland compositor, where they have been adaping the Gnome Mutter compositor&#xA;into a hybrid X and Wayland compositor. The talk aims to provide general guidance on writing a hybrid X and Wayland compositor without&#xA;going into many Mutter specifics.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
